 """Job state machine.
 
-    queued --start--> running --complete--> succeeded
-                              --fail-----> failed
+    queued --start----> running --complete--> succeeded
+       |                  |     --fail-----> failed
+       +----cancel--------+---- --cancel---> cancelled
 
 `succeeded`, `failed` and `cancelled` are terminal.
 """
